        "Cic. Tusc. 4.14 (Lewis &amp; Short)"
      ],
      "comment": "To let one’s spirits sink: what a person does who is depressed. Its opposite is <span lang=\"la\">animōs tollere</span> (Lucilius, in Lewis &amp; Short)."
